Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:00:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 83/91] Option to freeze the universe while the server is off

New world options FreezeWhileOff (off by default) and FreezeSkillTraining (on).
With FreezeWhileOff on, every game timer moves on at startup by the time the
server was off (from the heartbeat, restarts under 5 minutes are ignored), so
nothing happens while it's off:

- industry jobs, research agents, boosters, clone jump and respec timers
- kill rights, escalations, saved dungeons, mission offers and deadlines
- contracts, market orders, and the market sim's cells, jobs, shipments and
  income clock
- tower fuel cycles and reinforcement, structure timers, customs offices
- planet pins, launches and resource depletion
- wormhole lifetimes, incursions, sov indices, wars, corp votes, recruitment
  ads and insurance
- skill training too, unless FreezeSkillTraining is off
- bills, office rent and war bills, as PauseBillsWhileOff already did

Tested with a faked 2 hour downtime: orders, sim cells and jobs, wormholes,
incursions and the sim's income clock all moved by 2 hours.
